02:02:27,570 --> 02:02:30,490
Alright, next one says Brotherhood Beyond Borders.

2141
02:02:30,570 --> 02:02:33,060
Dear Junaid Bhai, hope you're doing well. I've followed your content for years.

2142
02:02:33,140 --> 02:02:38,060
for years and I know how often your comment section becomes a battlefield whenever you

2143
02:02:38,140 --> 02:02:41,770
talk about India or Pakistan in a fair light. The same recycled hate, the same hate that

2144
02:02:41,850 --> 02:02:44,366
the same divisions that people refuse to let go of.

2145
02:02:44,446 --> 02:02:48,630
But I want to share something from my own life, something real, something that stands.

2146
02:02:48,710 --> 02:02:52,836
stands in defiance of all this noise. This is my story. The year was.

2147
02:02:52,916 --> 02:02:57,728
The year was 2015 and I was just another Indian trying to make a living in Dubai.

2148
02:02:57,808 --> 02:02:59,279
The unexpected brotherhood.

2149
02:02:59,359 --> 02:03:03,080
I had landed in Dubai a few months earlier, fresh from Meerut.

2150
02:03:03,580 --> 02:03:06,279
Oh, I remembered Meerut Kebab.

2151
02:03:06,359 --> 02:03:09,835
So, there's a Meerut Kebab house in Karachi.

2152
02:03:09,915 --> 02:03:12,904
They do wonderful Bihari Boti.

2153
02:03:12,984 --> 02:03:13,284
Man!

2154
02:03:13,364 --> 02:03:18,530
Ready to take on the world with my new software engineering job. The city was a dazzling blur of glass towers and shimmering lights.

2155
02:03:18,610 --> 02:03:21,591
lights but behind this glamour life was tough.

2156
02:03:21,671 --> 02:03:26,594
Rent was sky high and my company had crammed me into a shared flat with four strangers.

2157
02:03:26,674 --> 02:03:29,900
One of them was my friend Arsalan from Karachi.

2158
02:03:29,980 --> 02:03:36,086
The first few weeks were very awkward not openly hostile but there was a quiet tension between us.

2159
02:03:36,166 --> 02:03:39,172
The kind that comes from decades of inherited baggage.

2160
02:03:39,252 --> 02:03:43,117
We were polite but distant careful not to step on each other's toes.

2161
02:03:43,197 --> 02:03:45,450
Then one night everything changed.

2162
02:03:45,530 --> 02:03:47,536
It started as most things do with cricket.

2163
02:03:47,616 --> 02:03:52,474
India and Pakistan were playing in the Asia cup and naturally the apartment was split in two.

2164
02:03:52,554 --> 02:03:57,034
The match was intense, the banter was flying and by the end something strange happened.

2165
02:03:57,114 --> 02:03:58,455
We weren't arguing anymore.

2166
02:03:58,535 --> 02:03:59,299
We were laughing.

2167
02:03:59,379 --> 02:04:00,952
The ice had cracked.

2168
02:04:01,032 --> 02:04:02,671
From that day on, things shifted.

2169
02:04:02,751 --> 02:04:04,062
We started cooking together.

2170
02:04:04,142 --> 02:04:10,144
His chicken korma became a weekend ritual and I introduced him to my mom's special vermicelli and poha recipe.

2171
02:04:10,224 --> 02:04:12,140
We would stay up late talking about home.

2172
02:04:12,220 --> 02:04:15,975
about how alike Delhi and Lahore really were about family,

2173
02:04:16,055 --> 02:04:19,940
food and the sheer absurdity of our country's endless fight.

2174
02:04:20,020 --> 02:04:25,478
Then in November 2015, I felt terribly sick, dengue fever, no family around, no insurance,

2175
02:04:25,558 --> 02:04:27,008
no cover hospitals bills.

2176
02:04:27,088 --> 02:04:30,219
My company was indifferent, but Arsalan, he was there.

2177
02:04:30,299 --> 02:04:34,901
He spent three nights in the hospital with me, making sure I had my medicines,

2178
02:04:34,981 --> 02:04:37,613
bringing food, updating my family back home.

2179
02:04:37,693 --> 02:04:39,170
When I got better, I found out.

2180
02:04:39,250 --> 02:04:44,130
found out that he had even covered a part of my bills when I was too weak to notice.

2181
02:04:44,210 --> 02:04:49,790
A few months later the tables turned, the market crashed and he lost his job overnight.

2182
02:04:49,870 --> 02:04:50,646
It was brutal.

2183
02:04:50,726 --> 02:04:55,626
I knew what that meant, a cancelled visa, a one way ticket back home, dreams cut short.

2184
02:04:55,706 --> 02:04:58,531
But by then he was my brother, not just a roommate.

2185
02:04:58,611 --> 02:05:01,517
So I pulled every string I could, spoke to my boss,

2186
02:05:01,597 --> 02:05:04,890
called in favors and within a week we found him a new job.

2187
02:05:05,220 --> 02:05:07,011
before he finished his notice period.

2188
02:05:07,091 --> 02:05:10,943
We weren't supposed to be friends, but life does not care about politics,

2189
02:05:11,023 --> 02:05:12,257
