2190
02:05:12,337 --> 02:05:16,615
In a city far from home, where we had no one but each other, none of that mattered.

2191
02:05:16,695 --> 02:05:18,060
What people refused to see.

2192
02:05:18,140 --> 02:05:22,043
Junaid Bhai, I know the kind of hate that gets thrown around in your comments,

2193
02:05:22,123 --> 02:05:25,290
