2194
02:05:25,370 --> 02:05:28,587
Indians and Pakistanis share stories like mine every single day.

2195
02:05:28,667 --> 02:05:33,140
In 2017, he got married in Karachi and I was there standing next to him as his best man.

2196
02:05:33,420 --> 02:05:37,190
In 2022 my sister got married.

2197
02:05:37,270 --> 02:05:41,330
