2198
02:05:41,410 --> 02:05:41,710
visit to India. So when people came, people came.

2199
02:05:41,790 --> 02:05:42,251
visit to India.

2200
02:05:42,331 --> 02:05:46,451
So when people came, people come at you, ranting about division, calling for hatred,

2201
02:05:46,531 --> 02:05:49,111
