2202
02:05:49,191 --> 02:05:50,410
Just remember in the real world.

2203
02:05:50,490 --> 02:05:53,970
the real world we have already moved on. Thank you for always speaking the truth.

2204
02:05:54,050 --> 02:05:57,330
Junaid Bhai, the world needs more of it. Warm regards. An Indian who knows better.

2205
02:05:57,410 --> 02:05:59,050
So yes, very heartful, very.

